# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: this workspace has its own resolution
# (the CI vendored check/test jobs use it), and an unpinned lock silently
# tested whatever crates.io resolved that day instead of the dependency graph
# the edge binary ships.
/target
**/*.rs.bk
dhat-heap.json
.vscode
.idea
.cover
bleeper.user.toml
.DS_Store
